cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and data for "A Digital Twin Prototype for Protecting Surface
  Source Waters"
message: >-
  If you use this software or the data published with it, please cite
  both the article and this repository.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/russellprimeau/source-water-digital-twin
abstract: >-
  Model configuration and forcing for the simulation sets reported in the
  article, the reduced precursor files its figures and tables are drawn
  from, and the scripts that produce each of them. Solver output, the
  hydrodynamic couplings, the Delft3D FM and DELWAQ kernels and
  third-party lake-level records are not included; README.md states what
  each exclusion is and why.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - source water protection
  - drinking water
  - hydrodynamic modelling
  - water quality
  - Delft3D FM
  - DELWAQ
  - unmanned surface vehicle
